  "body": "Vendors are ready to see all offers from interested purchasers on or before auction day.\r\n\r\nSpace to grow, work, and add value on a substantial 872sqm of freehold and just a short stroll from St Heliers Village.\r\n\r\nPositioned in a central and highly desirable St Heliers pocket, this property offers size, versatility, and exceptional location credentials. Set on an expansive 872sqm site, it presents an incredible foundation for families, tradespeople, hobbyists, or buyers looking to secure a footprint in a premier coastal suburb.\r\n\r\nInside, the home features three well-proportioned bedrooms complemented by a dedicated study-ideal for working from home or quiet study sessions. A standout highlight of the property is the exceptionally large workshop with multi-purpose space for home business needs, extensive storage, DIY projects, or creative pursuits. \r\n\r\nOutside, the generous grounds provide plenty of room for family living with ample scope to enhance, personalize, or redevelop in the future.Key Highlights\r\n\r\n*  Bedrooms & Workspaces: 3 bedrooms, separate study, plus a very large multi-use workshop \r\n*  Generous Land: Substantial 872sqm site offering rare space and potential in a central location\r\n*  Top School Zones: Zoned for highly regarded St Heliers Primary School and Glendowie College\r\n*  Lifestyle Location: An easy stroll to vibrant St Heliers Village, local cafes, parks, and the beachfront",
